1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:08,800
Draw a line segment with a given length.

2
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:19,280
Draw line segment AB 4 cm long.

3
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:32,910
To draw line segment AB 4 cm long, we do as follows:

4
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:39,220
Place the cm ruler on the white paper.

5
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,480
Left hand holds the ruler.

6
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,250
Right hand holds the pen.

7
00:00:45,710 --> 00:00:50,370
Mark a point at the 0 mark.

8
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:56,020
Mark the second point at the 4 mark.

9
00:00:57,310 --> 00:01:06,820
Use a pencil to connect from mark 0 to mark 4, write A, B at each point.

10
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:24,140
AB = 4 cm

11
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:33,650
Read the lesson again and continue with the exercises.

